---- Property: The AICA system does not exceed action limits in autonomous mode
---- This ensures the AI respects the configured action constraints

sload ../aica.maude

omod AICA-ACTION-LIMITS is
  inc AICA .

  vars P O G A D T M : Oid .
  var  S S' : String .
  var  Conf : Configuration .
  var  F : Float .
  var  N : Nat .

  ---- Abstract away GUI interactions for this test
  eq buttonPressed(O, G, "Toggle Autonomy") = none .
  eq valueChanged(O, G, S, S') = none .

endom

---- Test: Actions executed should not exceed ROUND-AMOUNT in autonomous mode
---- Expected: No solution should be found (system respects limits)
search { <PCA> create(Aica, oid(0), oid(1)), 0 } 
       =>* { < A : Actuator | amount : F > Conf, Tm } 
       such that F > float(ROUND-AMOUNT) .

eof